# Regenerated intermediates: byte-for-byte copies of versioned RAW files, produced by the
# versioned scripts in this directory. The RESULTS are committed; these inputs are not, to
# avoid committing the same archive three times. Every one is rebuilt by running the script
# named in the directory's README.
CODE-VALUE-LAB/*/RAW/
REFRESH-LAB/*/RAW/
MUTANTS/*.log
__pycache__/
_probe_*.py
_time_eval.py
_verify_m03.py
_drive_mutations.sh
_run_light.sh
_run_light2.sh
